id: pm-linear-uhu6
title: Legacy Linear upsert to a closed status omits the required close reason
description: "Offline real-tracker reproduction during issue 134 tests: seed a closed item with Linear provenance, feed a synthetic completed Linear issue through syncLinearIssues without atomic mode, and the update subprocess fails under governance.require_close_reason because its arguments have no close reason. Atomic import supplies an explicit close mutation reason. This is independent of whole-corpus reading; no provider access or credentials were used."
type: Issue
